# Tight U-turn (double tap) in slow motion: the presses land about a game frame apart, so the
# turn gate holds the second until the 50-unit gap. Shots every ~game frame as the camera
# swings round, then back at full speed running beside the trail.
wait 17
press c 3
wait 3
press z
wait 0.5
press left
press left
shot ut_01
shot ut_02
shot ut_03
shot ut_04
shot ut_05
shot ut_06
